<title>USA: PHLX to delay Stage Stores options.</title>
<headline>PHLX to delay Stage Stores options.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange said it delayed the start of trading in options on shares of Stage Stores Inc.</p>
<p>Earlier, the PHLX said the options would start trading on Wednesday, August 13.</p>
<p>The exchange gave no reason for the delay and no new starting date.</p>
<p>((--Chicago derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: chicago.derivatives.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
